  "description": "Woo Eun-Jo is an airport employee who’s secretly sleeping with the hottest and youngest plane captain, Ki Su-Ho. Eun-Jo is convinced their friends-with-benefits arrangement won’t ever become something more, but Su-Ho’s sweet gestures make it impossible to keep his feelings from growing. It doesn’t help that Su-Ho feels anxious himself at Eun-Jo’s constant mixed signals and actually wishes their relationship could take off as well. Buckle up, as this romantic flight will be experiencing A LOT of turbulence!\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
